{
 "title": "Reading Announcements on the Home Page",
 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>Reading Announcements on the Home Page</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"You might receive broadcast announcements, which are informational messages sent by your organization.\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"You might receive broadcast announcements, which are informational messages sent by your organization.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"></script></head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled collapsify-enabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page concept  - topic-topic concept-concept \" id=\"loio7b462b881be343f7a42f8e6e8404bccc\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">Reading Announcements on the Home Page</h1><div class=\"body conbody\"><p class=\"shortdesc\">You might receive broadcast announcements, which are informational messages sent by your\norganization.</p>\n<div class=\"p\">\n<ol class=\"ol\" id=\"loio7b462b881be343f7a42f8e6e8404bccc__ol_xbg_sdw_mpb\">\n<li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">When you sign in, announcements display in a rotating carousel on your home\npage:</p><p class=\"p\">\n<img class=\"inline\" id=\"loio7b462b881be343f7a42f8e6e8404bccc__image_p2v_2r3_dpb\" src=\"loio8eb0ceacada94e739ddcd1e463236f0f_LowRes.png\">\n</p><p class=\"p\">Announcements that you haven't yet read contain the label \"New.\"</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>Each announcement displays for five seconds, but you can stop message rotation by hovering\nthe pointer on the carousel or by clicking any dot at the bottom of the\ncarousel.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>Click <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Learn more</span> to read more information:</p><p class=\"p\">\n<img class=\"inline\" id=\"loio7b462b881be343f7a42f8e6e8404bccc__image_a5n_23c_npb\" src=\"loio5b9b14c231e3488c89020b1237917b70_LowRes.png\">\n</p><p class=\"p\">Click <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Close</span> to go back to the home page.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>After you've read all new announcements, the carousel moves to the bottom of the home page\nto create more space and to make the announcements less prominent.</p></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"related-links\"> <div class=\"relinfo\"><div class=\"relinfotitle \">Related Information</div><div><a class=\"link\" href=\"7192d47051874138a4436006b8e502aa.html\" title=\"All announcements are available in the Notifications menu.\">Reading Announcements from the Notifications Menu</a></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div></div></div></body></html>"
}